## Font License

IBM Plex Mono and Syne fonts are used in the application UI.

- **IBM Plex Mono** — SIL Open Font License 1.1
  https://github.com/IBM/plex

- **Syne** — SIL Open Font License 1.1
  https://github.com/EthanNakache/Syne-type

Both fonts are loaded via Google Fonts CDN in the live version.
The application functions fully without them (system font fallbacks are defined).
